WEBVTT

00:10:29.291 --> 00:10:31.210
And now, and in the future,

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:33.837
fashion's not just
about making yourself beautiful.

00:10:34.338 --> 00:10:38.967
It's also about making this planet
beautiful and livable for generations.

00:10:39.968 --> 00:10:41.136
Thank you.

00:10:41.178 --> 00:10:47.935
(Cheers and applause)